1
00:00:03,753 --> 00:00:06,753
(Howard:)So I got the craziest e-mail
this morning.

2
00:00:06,923 --> 00:00:11,723
l don't mean to burst your bubble,
but penile-enlargement pills do not work.

3
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:15,056
(Howard:)Believe me, I know.

4
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:19,146
(Howard:)The e-mail I got was from the office
of Stephen Hawking.

5
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,730
- You're kidding.
- Why?

6
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:22,935
(Howard:)He's coming to the university
to lecture...

7
00:00:23,106 --> 00:00:27,196
(Howard:)...and he's looking for an engineer to
maintain equipment on his wheelchair.

8
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,740
(Leonard:)That's amazing.
You'll be like his pit crew.

9
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:36,072
(Leonard:)A word of caution, I would not do
your Stephen Hawking impression...

10
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:37,994
(Leonard:)...in front of him.

11
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:40,248
(Howard(in Stephen Hawking voice):)You're right.

12
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:46,167
l suppose
that could be considered offensive.

13
00:00:46,921 --> 00:00:49,341
(Raj:)Oh, boy.
Oh, Sheldon's going to freak out.

14
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,257
(Leonard:)Yeah, he worships Hawking.

15
00:00:51,426 --> 00:00:55,386
l was thinking about bringing him along,
so he can meet the great man.

16
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:58,225
- That's really nice of you, Howard.
- It's no big deal.

17
00:00:58,391 --> 00:01:02,021
(Leonard:)Boy, a restraining order
from Stephen Hawking.

